{"version":1,"title":"Blog 1：[長欣集]诗二首 - SamuFlore","html":"<div class=\"l_main\" data-ui-surface=\"content\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"article-banner-wrap\"><div class=\"article banner top\">\n  <div class=\"content\">\n    \n    <div class=\"top bread-nav footnote\"><div class=\"top-row\"><div class=\"left\" id=\"breadcrumb\"><a class=\"cap breadcrumb\" href=\"/\">主页</a>\n<span class=\"sep\"></span><a class=\"cap breadcrumb\" href=\"/\">文章</a><span class=\"sep\"></span><a class=\"cap breadcrumb-link\" href=\"/categories/%E9%95%B7%E6%AC%A3%E9%9B%86/\">長欣集</a>\n</div><div class=\"right\"><span class=\"cap reading\">104 字 · 约 1 分钟</span></div></div><div class=\"meta-row\">\n<div class=\"flex-row preview-post-meta\" id=\"post-meta\"><a class=\"author\" href=\"/author/samuflore/\">Seymiris Asakawa</a><span class=\"sep\"></span><span class=\"text created\"><time datetime=\"2025-07-15T10:30:43.000Z\">2025-07-15</time></span><span class=\"sep updated\"></span><span class=\"text updated\">更新于：<time datetime=\"2026-02-20T06:56:15.040Z\">2026-02-20</time></span></div>\n</div></div>\n    \n    <div class=\"bottom only-title\">\n      \n      <div class=\"text-area\">\n        <h1 class=\"text title\"><span>Blog 1：[長欣集]诗二首</span></h1>\n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n  </div>\n  </div></div>\n<article class=\"md-text content\"><div class=\"tag-plugin poetry\"><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"title\">川上</div><div class=\"body\"><p>臺前瀧上望、曉霧隱晨輝<br>鳥鳴長天浪、凇華璃光杯<br>黛道負白雪、青枝承芬菲<br>墨川浮一葉、蒼雲何照歸</p></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"tag-plugin poetry\"><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"title\">予楊公之長安</div><div class=\"body\"><p>七十六年題名日、少年滿心在三千<br>而今秦川八百外、一步一顧瀟湘間<br>藤原魂斷蓬萊上、不見西行花滿天<br>月夜襲得心百感、落木生春又一年</p></div></div></div>\n</article>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n</div>","bodyClass":"content","layout":"post","type":"tech","textIndent":false}